msgid "Updating Generated JSON Data"
msgstr "更新生成的 JSON 数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:28
#: 5b0176cb10c94a43a065c738291dec06
msgid ""
"``scripts/motor-diagram-data/AP_Motors_test.json`` contains motor matrix "
"information for all supported frame classes and types and is used to "
"generate the diagram imagery. It should be updated whenever a new frame "
"class or type is added or existing ones are significantly changed. After "
"updating, re-generate motor diagrams using ``build_motor_diagrams.py`` as "
"described below."
msgstr ""
"``scripts/motor-diagram-data/AP_Motors_test.json`` "
"包含所有支持机架类型和类别的电机矩阵信息，用于生成图示图像。每当添加新机架类型或类别，或对现有类型进行重大更改时，都应更新此文件。更新后，使用如下所述的"
" ``build_motor_diagrams.py`` 重新生成电机图。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:31
#: 8030caf73b2449dd8a519718718bc0ec
msgid ""
"``AP_Motors_test.json`` is procedurally generated and is not intended to be "
"edited directly. Instead, edit ``AP_Motors_display.json`` as described below"
" if diagram output must be adjusted/customized."
msgstr ""
"``AP_Motors_test.json`` 是程序化生成的，不打算直接编辑。如果必须调整/自定义图示输出，请按如下所述编辑 "
"``AP_Motors_display.json``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:34
#: b255ec0326bd420ebd74862123a95f92
msgid "Updating AP_Motors_test.json (recommended method)"
msgstr "更新 AP_Motors_test.json（推荐方法）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:36
#: 787f6aefdd7144b9a7252a7ac1ad8b60
msgid "Enter the ardupilot build environment and execute the following:"
msgstr "进入 ArduPilot 构建环境并执行以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:47
#: f9fd979bdb7a40728b75e82c651eb970
msgid ""
"Move (or copy) the resulting file to ``ardupilot_wiki/scripts/motor-diagram-"
"data/``. Assuming the ``ardupilot_wiki`` environment is set up in the parent"
" directory of ``ardupilot`` :"
msgstr ""
"将生成的文件移动（或复制）到 ``ardupilot_wiki/scripts/motor-diagram-data/``。假设 "
"``ardupilot_wiki`` 环境设置在 ``ardupilot`` 的上级目录中："

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:53
#: b965719955ca411c8583e49ed71b8105
msgid ""
"Once the output has been verified, changes can be committed to a new branch,"
" and a pull request can be created."
msgstr "输出验证后，可将更改提交到新分支并创建拉取请求。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:56
#: 55e33f5b6d9e431ca94f3eebf0de26c9
msgid "Updating AP_Motors_test.json (alternate method)"
msgstr "更新 AP_Motors_test.json（备用方法）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:58
#: ee362d79393b4f26b20b025a9af5d293
msgid ""
"``ardupilot_wiki/scripts/generate_motor_json.py`` can be used to update "
"``AP_Motors_test.json`` independent of the ArduPilot build environment. It "
"fetches C++ header and source files from the ArduPilot repo and uses a "
"similar method to the ``AP_Motors_test`` executable. Output should be "
"functionally identical to ``AP_Motors_test`` for the purpose of generating "
"Copter motor diagrams, but it is a more fragile method and may not produce "
"JSON data for new/niche frame classes and types."
msgstr ""
"``ardupilot_wiki/scripts/generate_motor_json.py`` 可用于独立于 ArduPilot 构建环境更新 "
"``AP_Motors_test.json``。它从 ArduPilot 仓库获取 C++ 头文件和源文件，并使用与 "
"``AP_Motors_test`` 可执行文件类似的方法。对于生成 Copter 电机图，其输出在功能上应与 ``AP_Motors_test`` "
"相同，但这是一种更脆弱的方法，可能无法为新的/小众的机架类型生成 JSON 数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:60
#: cf75f9921b264e8990eee6b4266e2513
msgid "Enter the ardupilot_wiki build environment and execute the following:"
msgstr "进入 ardupilot_wiki 构建环境并执行以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:70
#: d06fa1f93d8a4e4996f3fe4d26d75f01
msgid ""
"There are a few custom options for the script. Run "
"``./scripts/generate_motor_json.py -h`` for a full list."
msgstr "脚本有一些自定义选项，运行 ``./scripts/generate_motor_json.py -h`` 获取完整列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:72
#: f24100ab8032445c94df399181d239c5
msgid ""
"Once the output has been verified, the backup file can be deleted before "
"committing changes to a new branch and creating a pull request."
msgstr "输出验证后，可在将更改提交到新分支并创建拉取请求之前删除备份文件。"

