#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:87
#: 9a830231635040009c05dd790cd13a14
msgid ""
"There are a number of other options for the script. Run "
"``./scripts/build_motor_diagrams.py -h`` for a full list."
msgstr "脚本还有其他选项，运行 ``./scripts/build_motor_diagrams.py -h`` 获取完整列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:90
#: d712c679273948f58f87576aedc48427
msgid "Altering the Appearance of Motor Diagrams"
msgstr "更改电机图外观"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:93
#: 16e1dec0d6fd4203adc6d89e3e844d68
msgid ""
"Most frame types do not require any additional display customization, but "
"any diagram's appearance can be modified as follows."
msgstr "大多数机架类型不需要额外的显示自定义，但任何图的外观均可按如下方式修改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:95
#: b948f1a8b5fb49bfb4d7149e09d6b642
msgid ""
"``scripts/motor-diagram-data/AP_Motors_display.json`` amplifies and/or "
"overrides the data in ``AP_Motors_test.json`` for selected frame types. "
"``AP_Motors_display.json`` can be edited to alter the appearance of "
"diagrams. Each field overrides the corresponding field in "
"``AP_Motors_test.json`` or adds amplifying information for display in the "
"diagram."
msgstr ""
"``scripts/motor-diagram-data/AP_Motors_display.json`` 对所选机架类型的 "
"``AP_Motors_test.json`` 中的数据进行补充和/或覆盖。可编辑 ``AP_Motors_display.json`` "
"以更改图的外观。每个字段覆盖 ``AP_Motors_test.json`` 中的对应字段或添加在图中显示的补充信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:97
#: a0534b0754394ba6bca12b3b7bc8b172
msgid ""
"After editing ``AP_Motors_display.json``, re-generate diagrams using "
"``build_motor_diagrams.py`` as described above."
msgstr ""
"编辑 ``AP_Motors_display.json`` 后，按上述方法使用 ``build_motor_diagrams.py`` 重新生成图。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:99
#: c45715f1550d46aebdef79e1a1748f0e
msgid ""
"All fields except class and frame IDs are optional (if not specified, values"
" from ``AP_Motors_test.json`` are used)"
msgstr "除机架类别和类型 ID 外，所有字段均为可选（如未指定，使用 ``AP_Motors_test.json`` 中的值）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:101
#: 0215cd603d8e49379e2ddac248d38cd5
msgid "``ClassName`` and ``TypeName`` override the title text"
msgstr "``ClassName`` 和 ``TypeName`` 覆盖标题文字"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:103
#: 157afe3062b845eeb5c7be178ae0f394
msgid ""
"``Notes`` are displayed below the title text as part of the diagram (smaller"
" font)"
msgstr "``Notes`` 作为图的一部分显示在标题文字下方（较小字体）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:105
#: 83e1cad7fb98485e8433b8f8818966c4
msgid "``WikiNotes`` add a wiki ```.. note::``` block below the diagram"
msgstr "``WikiNotes`` 在图下方添加 wiki ```.. note::``` 块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:107
#: e7ce44b6e63c4264900318504f7e1126
msgid ""
"``Comments`` are information only and ignored when generating the diagrams"
msgstr "``Comments`` 仅供参考，生成图时忽略"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:109
#: 75d2cea9a6ab4c5ca2672b17eb0997bb
msgid ""
"``Skip`` if true, this frame is skipped by the generator script (useful for "
"frames that have duplicate diagrams)"
msgstr "``Skip`` 如果为 true，生成脚本将跳过此机架（适用于有重复图的机架）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:111
#: 224b844a62f74e2a9c7c6a32d43c6631
msgid "``motors`` includes motor matrix data."
msgstr "``motors`` 包含电机矩阵数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:113
#: 4220cd55f27f419086e9a2d3dcd8d7d1
msgid "``Number`` is the intended motor output channel"
msgstr "``Number`` 是预期的电机输出通道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:115
#: 00d59868e49644ba8d347d6000479d2d
msgid ""
"``TestOrder`` is the order in which the motor is tested (letters ``A``, "
"``B``, ``C``, etc.)"
msgstr "``TestOrder`` 是电机测试的顺序（字母 ``A``、``B``、``C`` 等）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:117
#: 86a9303985ca401fb4f668e64d525ee2
msgid ""
"``Rotation`` is the motor rotation direction (CCW or CW). A ``?`` indicates "
"no yaw torque."
msgstr "``Rotation`` 是电机旋转方向（CCW 或 CW）。``?`` 表示无偏航力矩。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:119
#: 46363cabd37a40b09817ddbe38af0461
msgid ""
"``Roll`` is the \"roll factor\" of the motor and functions as an X "
"coordinate for the diagram. Positive is below the origin, and negative is "
"above. Generally, use values between -0.5 and 0.5."
msgstr "``Roll`` 是电机的「横滚因子」，在图中用作 X 坐标。正值在原点下方，负值在原点上方。通常使用 -0.5 至 0.5 之间的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:121
#: a01ba96c160a4f80b0eac65004df22a8
msgid ""
"``Pitch`` is the \"pitch factor\" of the motor and functions as a Y "
"coordinate for the diagram. Positive is to the right, and negative is to the"
" left. Generally, use values between -0.5 and 0.5."
msgstr "``Pitch`` 是电机的「俯仰因子」，在图中用作 Y 坐标。正值在右侧，负值在左侧。通常使用 -0.5 至 0.5 之间的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:123
#: d40d7ff1a52f421e97ddaef678def4b1
msgid ""
"``FrameLines`` can be used to override the default frame arm depiction, "
"where each motor is connected to the center of the frame. The coordinate "
"system functions the same as for ``Roll`` and ``Pitch``."
msgstr ""
"``FrameLines`` 可用于覆盖默认的机架臂描绘（每个电机连接到机架中心）。坐标系与 ``Roll`` 和 ``Pitch`` 相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-generating-motor-diagrams.rst:125
#: 547659b991a14f8e8bfe060e3dfdc551
msgid ""
"The following Quad A-Tail example showcases many of the available options:"
msgstr "以下 Quad A-Tail 示例展示了许多可用选项："
